 "mental_markers": {
  "_doc": "User rule 2026-11-02 (round 3): imagine/projection is 🧠🗯 (replaces the old eye-in-speech-bubble glyph, which was too close to 👁️). Every INTERNAL sense (internal_visual 👁️, internal_auditory 👂, internal_kinesthetic 🫶) also carries a mental marker: 💭 remembered or 🧠🗯 imagined. Chosen deterministically: a memory cue in the sentence -> 💭, otherwise 🧠🗯; the deciding cue is recorded. Round 4 user decision: memory is itself imagined, so 🧠🗯 is the DEFAULT on every internal sense; 💭 only for an explicit accurate-recall cue (remember, recall, as before, exactly as last time). 'recollect'/'as previously' dropped.",
